v 3
d 'DOCX': extended functions for putdocx, with sensitivity-label copying
d
d docx simplifies building formatted Word (.docx) reports with putdocx:
d title page, standardised headings, a table of contents with internal
d links, zebra-shaded tables, checkpoints and numbered output files.
d Subcommands it does not define are passed on to putdocx unchanged.
d
d docxlabel (also callable as docx label) copies or reports a Microsoft
d Purview sensitivity label of a .docx/.xlsx/.pptx file, using only
d Stata's built-in Java.
d
d Requires: Stata version 19
d Distribution-Date: 20261124
d Author: szabobarnaKI, Karolinska Institutet
d Support: https://github.com/szabobarnaKI/docx/issues
f docx.ado
f docx.sthlp
f docxlabel.ado
f docxlabel.sthlp
